WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.329 --> 00:00:05.580
We have a voicemail number, which is two one
nine two David P..

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:11.510
Here is a voicemail I received about potential
Trump vs. Biden debates.

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:12.531
Let's take a listen.

00:00:12.531 --> 00:00:15.210
Hey, David, this is Aristotle from Modesto,
California.

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:17.490
I just had a quick question.

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:23.119
What do you think about the debates that will
be happening with Joe Biden and Donald Trump?

00:00:23.119 --> 00:00:30.320
Because obviously Joe Biden has emphasized
that and is also excited to debate Trump.

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:33.290
And you think Joe Biden is getting, you know.

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:39.820
Maybe sweep the floor with Trump on the debates
because a display on the show you've covered

00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:43.310
that Trump is sweaty and it's very just nervous
and everything.

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:46.250
So do you think Trump give me a nervous wreck?

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:50.470
And that would would that give Joe Biden a
advantage?

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:51.770
Let me know.

00:00:51.770 --> 00:00:54.920
And also, I love the show.

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:55.920
OK.

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:56.920
You got cut off there.

00:00:56.920 --> 00:01:00.350
But that seemed like it was a very, very worthwhile
praise of The David Pakman Show.

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:01.350
So a couple of different things.

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:03.100
Number one, I don't know if there are going
to be debates.

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:04.720
I at this point, I really don't know.

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:06.890
I said before, I don't care if there are debates.

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:11.670
This is an election where I am uniquely unconcerned
with debates.

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:16.500
We know the differences are so vast between
these candidates that I don't need debates.

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:17.680
I don't need conventions.

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:21.350
I don't I really don't need any of this stuff.

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:22.990
The path forward is very clear.

00:01:22.990 --> 00:01:28.230
Now, if we learned anything from the Bernie
vs. Biden debate, remember when the Democratic

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:32.260
primary got down to just Bernie versus Biden,
you had a lot of people saying, oh, my God.

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:33.990
Dementia, Joe, he's going to implode.

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:38.420
Bernie is going to mop the floor with him
and take over the primary.

00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:40.350
And it was just like very uneventful.

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:42.000
And Biden did fine enough.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:45.820
And as we know, he ended up very easily winning
the primary.

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:51.840
In general, the expectation that debates are
going to dramatically turn the race I think

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:54.229
are overblown expectations.

00:01:54.229 --> 00:01:59.340
That being said, cognitively, Trump is not
where he was three and a half years ago.

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:06.190
And I readily admit that Joe Biden has also
slowed down, notably over the last 10 years,

00:02:06.190 --> 00:02:07.470
you know, since he debated Paul Ryan.

00:02:07.470 --> 00:02:09.759
I guess that was eight years ago in 2012.

00:02:09.759 --> 00:02:13.280
Joe Biden also he's close to 80 years old
and it's a different Joe Biden.

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:16.480
I don't have any interest in pretending that's
not the case.

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:24.940
So there is always the possibility that either
of a candidate could do sort of self-inflicted

00:02:24.940 --> 00:02:27.630
damage due to a poor debate performance.

00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:33.530
But anybody suggesting that it's clear that
the debates are going to be so one sided that

00:02:33.530 --> 00:02:37.870
it will destroy one candidate's possibilities?

00:02:37.870 --> 00:02:40.430
I don't see that as as based, in fact.

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:43.580
And again, I don't know that there are going
to be debates.

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:46.960
We will hopefully learn specifics about that
soon.

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:49.380
We have a great bonus show for you today.

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:53.330
We will talk about some who are calling for
Biden to simply refuse to debate Trump.

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:56.770
We'll talk about the optics versus the strategy.

00:02:56.770 --> 00:03:00.960
And we will talk about these mystery seeds
that Americans are receiving.

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:05.590
I actually received some of these and I have
a story to tell about this.

00:03:05.590 --> 00:03:09.680
And we will discuss that and so much more
on today's bonus show.

